Wait.

943
41:32.150 --> 41:32.820
Medical kit.

944
41:32.820 --> 41:33.370
Yes.

945
41:47.960 --> 41:48.650
Here.

946
41:57.650 --> 41:58.400
Go home.

947
42:07.710 --> 42:08.760
These men with guns are

948
